# INJECTED, not authored: the queenzee writes a xell's harness (persona + memory) into
# .zeehive/harness/ at provision. It is per-xell state, and it has now been swept into a commit by
# a `git add -A` twice — ignore it so there is no third time.
.zeehive/
.claude/

# Messages the queenzee DELIVERS into a xell (`zee say` / inbox drops). Per-xell runtime data,
# not source — and a tracked drop directory means every cxell that runs `git add -A` commits its
# own mail into an unrelated landing.
.zee-inbox/
